问题位于 [ScheduleCoordinator.kt (line 391)]\(/Users/jace/Documents/WK/newblesdk/android/sdk/vk-ble-core/src/main/java/com/vk/sdk/ble/api/service/ScheduleCoordinator.kt:391)。consume() 使用 = when (...) 表达式体，分支中不能写 return true。
应改为分支表达式：
if (entries.size == expectedCount) {
&#x20;   invalidSnapshot = true
&#x20;   response.completeExceptionally(...)
} else {
&#x20;   entries[packet.entry.scheduleId.protocolValue] = packet.entry
}
true
